WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Click Code. Then click Variables.

00:10.000 --> 00:22.000
Make a variable named time. Choose For all sprites.

00:22.000 --> 00:35.000
Make a variable named score. Choose For all sprites.

00:35.000 --> 00:44.000
Keep both boxes checked. Click goal 1. Add when green flag clicked.

00:44.000 --> 00:55.000
Add set time to 0. Then add set score to 0.

00:55.000 --> 01:06.000
Add set tempo to 60. Stop when all 4 blocks are connected.
